screenshots/theme/
screenshots/theme-run-*.log

# Demo-mode exceptions (v2.3.0): the demo-data fixtures are SANITISED copies
# (generated by tools/make_demo_fixtures.py) and docs/config.js is the
# credential-free demo build — these are safe and required for the hosted
# showcase, unlike the runtime originals ignored above.
!**/demo-data/rooms.json
!**/demo-data/weather.json
!docs/config.js

# Full-height captures of the live house with real names and readings.
